<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="544247523"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1445725448"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Everybody Hates Me"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="The Chainsmokers"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Everybody Hates Me"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:43.467"><div begin="00:01.420" end="03:37.825"><p begin="00:01.420" end="00:04.243" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Yeah, let's do it again but, uh, this time, uh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再来一次 但这一次 让我们全力以赴 彻底疯狂吧</span></p><p begin="00:04.253" end="00:05.539" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Let's go full psycho</p><p begin="00:07.098" end="00:09.452" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Yeah, I just want to drink tequila with my friends<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想和我的朋友喝龙舌兰</span></p><p begin="00:09.859" end="00:12.583" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">She said she cheated 'cause she's tryna get ahead<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她说她骗了我 因为她想上头条</span></p><p begin="00:13.149" end="00:15.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">The more I read it, yeah, the more I take offense<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看得越多 就越会受到冒犯</span></p><p begin="00:16.123" end="00:18.798" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">I'm so defeated, I can't get outside my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是如此挫败 我不能停止思考</span></p><p begin="00:19.205" end="00:21.694" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">I post a picture of myself 'cause I'm lonely<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我发了一张自拍 因为我很寂寞</span></p><p begin="00:21.704" end="00:23.192" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Everyone knows what I look like<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大家都知道我长什么样</span></p><p begin="00:23.202" end="00:25.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Not even one of them knows me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但没有一个能够理解我</span></p><p begin="00:25.546" end="00:28.085" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Yeah, I just want to drink tequila with my friends<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想和我的朋友喝龙舌兰</span></p><p begin="00:28.518" end="00:30.955" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">I'm so defeated, I just want this shit to end<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是如此挫败 我想忘记这种感觉</span></p><p begin="00:30.995" end="00:34.509" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">So I walk into the club like everybody hates me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我去酒吧 感觉所有人都恨我</span></p><p begin="00:37.526" end="00:40.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">I walk into the club like everybody hates me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我走进酒吧 感觉所有人都恨我</span></p><p begin="00:43.697" end="00:47.094" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">I'm talkin' to myself, shit, now they think I'm crazy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在自言自语 可能他们觉得我疯了</span></p><p begin="00:49.868" end="00:53.206" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">I walk into the club like everybody hates me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我走进酒吧 感觉所有人都恨我</span></p><p begin="00:53.206" end="00:54.715" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Everybody hates me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大家都厌恶我</span></p><p begin="00:54.501" end="00:56.237" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Like everybody hates me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉所有人都恨我</span></p><p begin="01:06.939" end="01:08.738" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">Like everybody hates me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉所有人都恨我</span></p><p begin="01:13.360" end="01:18.741" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Everybody, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有人</span></p><p begin="01:20.722" end="01:22.665" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">I'm a product of the internet<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是网络的产物</span></p><p begin="01:22.953" end="01:25.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Now I'm face to face with all the voices in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我和他们面对面接触 脑海里充斥着各种声音</span></p><p begin="01:26.051" end="01:28.842" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">I can't even check the time without facing regret<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我甚至不知道现在是什么时间 满是懊悔</span></p><p begin="01:29.023" end="01:31.777" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Why do I still have to mean everything I ever said?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何我要对我说过的话负责呢</span></p><p begin="01:33.544" end="01:36.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">And I'm not trying to be like "poor me," I made it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我努力使自己看起来不是那么寒酸 我做到了</span></p><p begin="01:36.140" end="01:39.648" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">I'm just trying to stay normal now that they know what my name is<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只想做个普通正常人 现在人们都知道了我的名字</span></p><p begin="01:39.917" end="01:42.426" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Yeah, I just want to drink tequila with my friends<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想和我的朋友喝龙舌兰</span></p><p begin="01:43.002" end="01:45.442" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">They're the reason that I still am who I am<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为他们 我才依然是我</span></p><p begin="01:45.486" end="01:48.915" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">So I walk into the club like everybody hates me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我去酒吧 感觉所有人都恨我</span></p><p begin="01:51.826" end="01:55.248" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">I walk into the club like everybody hates me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我走进酒吧 感觉所有人都恨我</span></p><p begin="01:58.035" end="02:01.479" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">I'm talkin' to myself, shit, now they think I'm crazy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在自言自语 可能他们觉得我疯了</span></p><p begin="02:04.214" end="02:07.535" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">I walk into the club like everybody hates me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我走进酒吧 感觉所有人都恨我</span></p><p begin="02:07.535" end="02:09.063" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">Everybody hates me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大家都厌恶我</span></p><p begin="02:08.919" end="02:10.581" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">Like everybody hates me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉所有人都恨我</span></p><p begin="02:21.271" end="02:23.794" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">Like everybody, everybody hates me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉所有人都恨我</span></p><p begin="02:35.232" end="02:38.516" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">I walk into the club like everybody hates me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我走进酒吧 感觉所有人都恨我</span></p><p begin="02:41.318" end="02:44.878" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">I walk into the club like everybody hates me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我走进酒吧 感觉所有人都恨我</span></p><p begin="02:47.561" end="02:50.986" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">I walk into the club like everybody hates me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我走进酒吧 感觉所有人都恨我</span></p><p begin="02:56.892" end="03:03.639" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">I walk into the club like everybody, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我走进酒吧 感觉所有人</span></p><p begin="03:04.758" end="03:06.439" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Everybody<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有人</span></p><p begin="03:07.953" end="03:09.529" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Everybody<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有人</span></p><p begin="03:08.972" end="03:15.887" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">I walk into the club like everybody, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我走进酒吧 感觉所有人</span></p><p begin="03:17.242" end="03:19.047" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Everybody<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有人</span></p><p begin="03:21.674" end="03:25.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">I walk into the club like everybody hates me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我走进酒吧 感觉所有人都恨我</span></p><p begin="03:29.639" end="03:37.825" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">Everybody, yeah, everybody<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人见人嫌 呵 人见人嫌</span></p></div></body></tt>